b that. The easiest way is to just fill in the dots like it's a trait. No need for labels, just count.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, if you've got 0 Harmony, don't fill in any dots.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-23T08:22:38-07:00","id":489504,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/482243-werewolf-second-edition-final-version-changes-and-possible-remaining-errors?p=488355#post488355\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Since the character sheet is written in English and English is read left to right, I think it's pretty safe to assume the leftmost dot is 1 and the rightmost dot is 10.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, that's true, however orientation changes and not immediately being able to say whether 1 or 10 is blood or bone leaves me wanting some extra clarity. I believe that's why the morality trait has clasically been numbered - as quick reference so people don't have to count.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc